{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At a time when much of the world remained undiscovered by other civilizations there was a small island called Fair...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing with Jester</strong> is a typing game with a 8-Bit retro fourscale style. Imagine those classic handhelds had a keyboard and a game like this. Sounds awesome right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kingdom Needs a Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Clown is calling for the fastest fingers in the land. The Kingdom of Fair is in a state of chaos, and words are your only weapons. Embark on a typing quest to  save the realm one keystroke at a time. The show must go on\u2014and the kingdom depends on it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words as Weapons </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type to survive. Defeat enemies before they reach you in a test of speed and accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.poster.avif?t=1772506809\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.webm?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.mp4?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses in the story levels that will test your typing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.poster.avif?t=1772506809\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.webm?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.mp4?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't end when the story does. Push your WPM to the limit in endless mode. Climb the Steam Leaderboards and prove you are the fastest typer in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available Now:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial + first 3 story levels (with bosses) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode with leaderboards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 playable Jesters (male/female) + 4 unlockable characters for endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, Achievements &amp; Trading Cards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about clowns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 additional story levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 new unlockable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded dictionary (~3000 words per language)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Some day i will be a touch typist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/4d172b51272119c63f6f9a173c28f7fc1e417729.jpg"},{"name":"I typed so hard a game came out...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/9a769149995e55dc6c784fb1007fd19fc5c93094.jpg"},{"name":"Selfie Stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/2f7ced00d610cdf55c3627bebe359780c77a0581.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner Typist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/346e35392e03464e4d5448a47962196647bfd9b4.jpg"},{"name":"Intermediate Typist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/c0ad308af633334e28016c8fb77b9a34e762cf7d.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Typist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/8b4bbd0d534afe4b0eaf2e66f3b1b666c361e03f.jpg"},{"name":"Typing Superstar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/4804bf1f04cab97918b122a50cbfe175a5b0aa19.jpg"},{"name":"Jester's Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/03641dd46e46f1feab022f0a359e29a79a045d34.jpg"},{"name":"Plains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/d3d55a3cd2dee62ddc4ceb17e60456f8b44225e9.jpg"},{"name":"Capital City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/496520/3d6a72f92abbdd410882188d9e2ef1a005815c0e.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/496520?t=1772506809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/496520?t=1772506809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/f8fddc797691ecaad23efdf270b0ca0da5f90011/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772506809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/f8fddc797691ecaad23efdf270b0ca0da5f90011/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772506809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":544450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/9c2efc4efa931b6bb54bf363fc204826.avif?t=1772506809\" width=914 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The show is only just beginning! While the current release provides a solid foundation, we are moving steadily toward <strong>Version 1.0</strong>, which will introduce the final levels and reveal the complete story of <strong>Typing with Jester</strong>.\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At a time when much of the world remained undiscovered by other civilizations there was a small island called Fair...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing with Jester</strong> is a typing game with a 8-Bit retro fourscale style. Imagine those classic handhelds had a keyboard and a game like this. Sounds awesome right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kingdom Needs a Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Clown is calling for the fastest fingers in the land. The Kingdom of Fair is in a state of chaos, and words are your only weapons. Embark on a typing quest to  save the realm one keystroke at a time. The show must go on\u2014and the kingdom depends on it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words as Weapons </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type to survive. Defeat enemies before they reach you in a test of speed and accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.poster.avif?t=1772506809\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.webm?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/4748e548189ddd97220771f7b0cf793d.mp4?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses in the story levels that will test your typing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.poster.avif?t=1772506809\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.webm?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/extras/c7d5ba3d76203778e2afa85a7c740a67.mp4?t=1772506809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't end when the story does. Push your WPM to the limit in endless mode. Climb the Steam Leaderboards and prove you are the fastest typer in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available Now:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial + first 3 story levels (with bosses) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode with leaderboards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 playable Jesters (male/female) + 4 unlockable characters for endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, Achievements &amp; Trading Cards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about clowns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 additional story levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 new unlockable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded dictionary (~3000 words per language)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Netnip Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496520/header.jpg?t=1772506809","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/496520/656659341/c7365e9456b1a3c5fbaa9f86509d96e05a5ebfb4/1770002430/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770003450","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/496520/656659341/c7365e9456b1a3c5fbaa9f86509d96e05a5ebfb4/1770002430/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770003450","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/496520/656659341/c7365e9456b1a3c5fbaa9f86509d96e05a5ebfb4/1770002430/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770003450","id":257161910,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161910/5a56901a519857c2588fa503ffc535b9e65272c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770003450"}],"name":"Typing with Jester","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Typing with Jester - $5.99 USD","packageid":113311,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy Typing with